# Smithers 0.x sources that Phase 4 lanes port from. Nothing here is live code,
# nothing imports it, and no tool should walk it.
#
# Every file below is already tracked, so git keeps versioning it; these rules
# only keep the directory out of the walks that honor .gitignore: the
# @smthrs/targets declared-input scan behind `known-files.d.ts`, eslint, vitest,
# dprint, and ripgrep. `pnpm run check:legacy-absent` is the Phase 7 gate that
# fails while this directory exists.
*
!.gitignore
